0 Junkbot - minifig-scale figure (starter base model)
0 Name: junkbot.ldr
0 Author: generated for Alsey
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0
0 // ============================================================
0 // NOTES
0 // -Y is UP in LDraw. 1 brick = 24 LDU tall, 1 stud = 20 LDU.
0 // Vertical/side offsets below are APPROXIMATE. Open in LeoCAD
0 // or Studio and nudge each part to seat it - the minifig-leg
0 // assembly and the slope have origins that won't line up to
0 // the exact LDU without hand-adjustment.
0 //
0 // Colors used:
0 //   25 = Orange              (head + body)
0 //   14 = Yellow              (lid)
0 //   71 = Light Bluish Gray   (legs + key)
0 // ============================================================
0
0 // ---- Legs: light-gray minifig hips + legs ----
0 // 3815c01 is the current file (old 970c00 redirects here).
0 // Sub-parts if you want to pose legs independently for a walk
0 // cycle: 3815 (hips), 3816 (left leg), 3817 (right leg).
1 71 0 -40 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3815c01.dat
0
0 // ---- Body: orange 2x2 brick ----
1 25 0 -60 -10 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3003.dat
0
0 // ---- Head: orange 2x2 45-degree slope ----
0 // Swap to 3039p05.dat for the printed grille face
0 // (note: that print is BLACK on the slope, not orange-on-orange).
1 25 0 -84 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3039.dat
0
0 // ---- Lid: yellow 1x2 tile, sitting on the flat top/back of the head ----
1 14 0 -92 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3069b.dat
0
0 // ---- Wind-up key: light gray, poking out the left side ----
0 // 4234 is oversized vs the sprite; rotated 90 deg about Z here.
0 // Reposition / rescale to taste.
0
0 STEP
